    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzdotrufck2l",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "When you think about the Labs' weird approach to software releases (sudden changes, bad communication), it is worth remembering that a core belief is that these products are a temporary thing they have to do to raise money for a couple years until \"true\" AGI makes all products obsolete.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mzdotrufck2l",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-02T15:57:21.227Z",
      "likes": 43,
      "replies": 4,
      "reposts": 2,
      "score": 6.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.7,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 2.3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:eqgbahkj5art5neligzjeqs7/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzazk5zyhc2b",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "AI resistant learning conditions are just less exploitative teacher worker conditions.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mzazk5zyhc2b",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-01T14:30:50.389Z",
      "likes": 44,
      "replies": 2,
      "reposts": 8,
      "score": 6,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.8,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 27.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mz7swluwac2w",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "The Pro series of GPT models continues to be really impressive for one-shot problems that involve complex calculations, references, or sophisticated ideas.\n\nIt isn't particularly fast (or particularly pleasant) to use but GPT-6 Astra Pro gives that \"ask one question of the great oracle\" feel.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mz7swluwac2w",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-01T02:59:51.629Z",
      "likes": 62,
      "replies": 3,
      "reposts": 2,
      "score": 6,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 39.3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3myzwg2oxgk25",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "This is good advice from the Claude Code team (posted on X) for how to think about working with models like Opus 5.5.\n\nI would add: build checkpoints where the model reports back to you with interim ideas or prototypes so you can guide & give feedback, rather than one-shotting on your goal.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3myzwg2oxgk25",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-29T18:46:13.264Z",
      "likes": 174,
      "replies": 11,
      "reposts": 6,
      "score": 5.9,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.3,
        "recency": 0.4,
        "age_hours": 95.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:rrjvo5jwuateqep2i7ih5ckl/app.bsky.feed.post/3myuio2akg22n",
      "handle": "cfiesler.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Casey Fiesler",
      "text": "Pleased to announce that my silly TikToks about AI are now officially *major award winning* silly TikToks about AI. :) \n\nThanks to @scicommexcellence.nationalacademies.org for this award but also for helping legitimize/incentivize science communication!\n\nwww.nationalacademies.org/news/nationa...",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cfiesler.bsky.social/post/3myuio2akg22n",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-27T14:56:50.143Z",
      "likes": 300,
